[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775664862","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115198#issuecomment-3775664862","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115198","id":3775664862,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hDBLe","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T01:12:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T01:12:08Z","body":"Alright, I've done a little more investigation, and I think it's `VariantCaster<T>::cast()` that would have caught this in the past, which would have happened earlier than the creation of the `RequiredParam<T>`. This is used as part of the `MethodBindT::call()`, which is what GDScript is using to call the method in this case.\r\n\r\nSo, we could theoretically add a specialization for `VariantCaster<T>` that would validate `Variant` to `RequiredParam<T>` conversions\r\n\r\nHowever, even if we did that, we'd still need the `Object::cast_to<T>()` that this PR adds in the `RequiredParam<T>(Variant)` constructor, because we don't just have `MethodBindT::call()` to worry about: we also need to handle this correctly within the engine, when a method with a `RequiredParam<T>` argument is called directly with a `Variant`.\r\n\r\nBut we wouldn't want to have this check in both a `VariantCaster<T>` specialization _and_ the `RequiredParam<T>(Variant)` constructor, because then the check would happen twice when calling via `MethodBindT::call()`.\r\n\r\nSo, in the end, I think my original change was basically right. :-) I've also taken @Ivorforce's suggestion of just moving the contents of `required_ptr.h` into `object.h`, to solve the weird include thing\r\n\r\nIn conclusion: not a DRAFT anymore!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775664862/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777945958","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115198#issuecomment-3777945958","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115198","id":3777945958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hLuFm","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T12:43:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T12:43:34Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777945958/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]